{"sha": "b39438fe090cd909e7f41387492b2502ad985fb843eda903dbb373b8eb5b1ef6", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:surfaces} 章 --- 曲面}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:1}", "令 $\\sigma(\\theta, r) = (r\\cos\\theta,\\ r\\sin\\theta,\\ r)$：", "\\[", "\\sigma_\\theta = (-r\\sin\\theta,\\ r\\cos\\theta,\\ 0),", "\\qquad", "\\sigma_r = (\\cos\\theta,\\ \\sin\\theta,\\ 1),", "\\]", "当 $r > 0$ 时两者线性无关。点 $M_0 =", "\\sigma(\\theta_0, r_0)$ 处的切平面过 $M_0$，方向为", "$\\sigma_\\theta, \\sigma_r$。而 $M_0 - O = r_0(\\cos\\theta_0,", "\\sin\\theta_0, 1) = r_0\\,\\sigma_r(\\theta_0, r_0)$ 本身就是切方向，", "故顶点 $O$ 位于切平面上。（这", "是锥面的一般性质：锥面由过顶点的直线", "构成，且切平面包含经过", "切点的直母线。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:2}", "将\\cref{prop:b2:surfaces:gradient}用于 $f(x,y,z) =", "\\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2} + \\frac{z^2}{c^2}$，则 $\\nabla", "f(x_0,y_0,z_0) = 2\\bigl(\\frac{x_0}{a^2}, \\frac{y_0}{b^2},", "\\frac{z_0}{c^2}\\bigr) \\neq 0$（于曲面上）。切平面为", "\\[", "\\frac{x_0}{a^2}(x - x_0) + \\frac{y_0}{b^2}(y - y_0)", "+ \\frac{z_0}{c^2}(z - z_0) = 0,", "\\qquad\\text{即}\\qquad", "\\frac{x_0\\,x}{a^2} + \\frac{y_0\\,y}{b^2} + \\frac{z_0\\,z}{c^2} = 1,", "\\]", "利用 $(x_0, y_0, z_0)$ 满足椭球面方程 ---", "“拆分平方”法则，推广了球面切平面方程 $\\langle", "M_0, M \\rangle = R^2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:3}", "$\\sigma_u = (-v\\sin u,\\ v\\cos u,\\ a)$ 与 $\\sigma_v = (\\cos u,\\", "\\sin u,\\ 0)$，故", "\\[", "E = v^2 + a^2, \\qquad F = 0, \\qquad G = 1,", "\\qquad", "\\sqrt{EG - F^2} = \\sqrt{v^2 + a^2} > 0", "\\]", "（螺旋面处处正则，包括其轴线上 $v =", "0$）。这一片的面积为：", "\\[", "\\mathcal{A} = \\int_0^{2\\pi}\\!\\!\\int_0^1", "\\sqrt{v^2 + a^2}\\;\\dd v\\,\\dd u", "= 2\\pi\\cdot\\frac12\\Bigl[v\\sqrt{v^2 + a^2}", "+ a^2\\ln\\bigl(v + \\sqrt{v^2 + a^2}\\bigr)\\Bigr]_0^1 ,", "\\]", "即 $\\mathcal{A} = \\pi\\Bigl(\\sqrt{1 + a^2} +", "a^2\\ln\\frac{1 + \\sqrt{1 + a^2}}{a}\\Bigr)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:4}", "偏导数为：", "\\[", "\\sigma_\\theta = \\bigl(-(R + r\\cos\\psi)\\sin\\theta,\\", "(R + r\\cos\\psi)\\cos\\theta,\\ 0\\bigr),", "\\qquad", "\\sigma_\\psi = \\bigl(-r\\sin\\psi\\cos\\theta,\\", "-r\\sin\\psi\\sin\\theta,\\ r\\cos\\psi\\bigr).", "\\]", "于是", "\\[", "E = (R + r\\cos\\psi)^2,", "\\qquad", "F = r\\sin\\psi\\cos\\psi\\,(R + r\\cos\\psi)", "\\bigl(\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta - \\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\bigr) = 0,", "\\qquad", "G = r^2 ,", "\\]", "故 $\\sqrt{EG - F^2} = r(R + r\\cos\\psi) \\geq r(R - r) > 0$，", "处处正则。面积为：", "\\[", "\\mathcal{A}", "= \\int_0^{2\\pi}\\!\\!\\int_0^{2\\pi} r(R + r\\cos\\psi)", "\\,\\dd\\theta\\,\\dd\\psi", "= 2\\pi r \\Bigl(2\\pi R + r\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\cos\\psi\\,\\dd\\psi\\Bigr)", "= 4\\pi^2 R r ,", "\\]", "其中 $\\cos\\psi$ 项的积分为零 --- 帕普斯定理：面积", "$=$（旋转圆周的长）$\\times$（", "其中心所经过的距离）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:5}", "对 $\\sigma(x, y) = (x, y, f(x,y))$，有 $\\sigma_x = (1, 0, f_x)$，", "$\\sigma_y = (0, 1, f_y)$，故 $E = 1 + f_x^2$，$F = f_xf_y$，$G = 1", "+ f_y^2$，并有", "\\[", "EG - F^2 = (1 + f_x^2)(1 + f_y^2) - f_x^2f_y^2", "= 1 + f_x^2 + f_y^2 ,", "\\]", "由此得所述面积公式。对 $f = \\frac12(x^2 + y^2)$，在", "单位圆盘上 $1 + f_x^2 + f_y^2 = 1 + x^2 + y^2$，并在极", "坐标下（$x = \\rho\\cos\\alpha$，$y = \\rho\\sin\\alpha$，雅可比行列式", "$\\rho$，见\\cref{ch:b2:multint}）：", "\\[", "\\mathcal{A}", "= \\int_0^{2\\pi}\\!\\!\\int_0^1 \\sqrt{1 + \\rho^2}\\;\\rho", "\\,\\dd\\rho\\,\\dd\\alpha", "= 2\\pi\\Bigl[\\tfrac13(1 + \\rho^2)^{3/2}\\Bigr]_0^1", "= \\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\bigl(2\\sqrt2 - 1\\bigr).", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:6}", "由\\cref{ex:b2:surfaces:spherearea}的计算，$E =", "R^2\\cos^2\\varphi$，$F = 0$，$G = R^2$，故由", "\\cref{prop:b2:surfaces:curvelength}可得", "\\[", "L = \\int_a^b R\\sqrt{\\cos^2\\varphi(t)\\,\\theta'(t)^2", "+ \\varphi'(t)^2}\\;\\dd t .", "\\]", "设端点为 $(\\theta_0, \\varphi_1)$ 与 $(\\theta_0,", "\\varphi_2)$，$\\varphi_1 < \\varphi_2$。对任一连接两点的曲线，", "\\[", "L \\geq \\int_a^b R\\,\\abs{\\varphi'(t)}\\,\\dd t", "\\geq R\\,\\Bigl|\\int_a^b \\varphi'(t)\\,\\dd t\\Bigr|", "= R\\,(\\varphi_2 - \\varphi_1),", "\\]", "略去非负项 $\\cos^2\\varphi\\,\\theta'^2$，并利用", "积分的三角不等式。子午线弧", "$\\theta \\equiv \\theta_0$，$\\varphi$ 从 $\\varphi_1$ 增至", "$\\varphi_2$ 的弧，其长度恰为 $R(\\varphi_2 - \\varphi_1)$，它", "是最短的。（子午线是大圆；这是最初、", "最基本的情形：球面测地线皆为", "大圆。）", "\\end{solution}", ""]}